OL,3,GNEWSAIOPC to probe if police could have
OL,4,Astopped killing
OL,5,
OL,6,FHewitt was sentenced to an indefinite
OL,7,Fhospital detention order for diminished
OL,8,Fresponsibility manslaughter. A coroner
OL,9,Fhas confirmed an inquest will be held.
